   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: the outgoing link already gets you to the first hop",
   "originalText": "The rule: the outgoing link already gets you to the first hop",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b16-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 740,
   "height": 60,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "first hop N = the router after S on the post-convergence path\nfirst segment = PrefixSID(N) or AdjSID(S→N)   →  drop it\nexception: N is D itself  →  keep PrefixSID(D) (the destination’s label, B17)",
   "originalText": "first hop N = the router after S on the post-convergence path\nfirst segment = PrefixSID(N) or AdjSID(S→N)   →  drop it\nexception: N is D itself  →  keep PrefixSID(D) (the destination’s label, B17)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b16-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 236,
   "width": 972,
   "height": 128,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  RFC 9855 §5: a repair is an outgoing interface plus a repair list. The interface is always the\n   path’s first link, so the packet arrives at N with no help.\n•  A label for N would only be popped by N straight away. Dropping it saves a label, and labels are\n   limited (MSD, A15).\n•  The greedy walk (B15) can’t know this: from S, N is often the furthest safe Prefix-SID, or the next\n   hop needs an Adj-SID.",
   "originalText": "•  RFC 9855 §5: a repair is an outgoing interface plus a repair list. The interface is always the\n   path’s first link, so the packet arrives at N with no help.\n•  A label for N would only be popped by N straight away. Dropping it saves a label, and labels are\n   limited (MSD, A15).\n•  The greedy walk (B15) can’t know this: from S, N is often the furthest safe Prefix-SID, or the next\n   hop needs an Adj-SID.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b16-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 374,
   "width": 511,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example 3 from B, step by step (from the engine)",
   "originalText": "Example 3 from B, step by step (from the engine)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b16-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 408,
   "width": 572,
   "height": 105,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "From  Try Y  (a)          (b)                          Segment\n----  -----  -----------  ---------------------------  -------------\nB     C      4 vs 10  ✗   4 < 0 + 1 + 3 = 4   ✗        AdjSID(B→C)\nC     A      3 = 3    ✓   3 < 4 + 1 + 0 = 5   ✓        PrefixSID(A)\nclean-up: AdjSID(B→C) only reaches the first hop C  →  dropped\nresult:   [PrefixSID(A)] = 16003, out via C, 0 extra labels",
   "originalText": "From  Try Y  (a)          (b)                          Segment\n----  -----  -----------  ---------------------------  -------------\nB     C      4 vs 10  ✗   4 < 0 + 1 + 3 = 4   ✗        AdjSID(B→C)\nC     A      3 = 3    ✓   3 < 4 + 1 + 0 = 5   ✓        PrefixSID(A)\nclean-up: AdjSID(B→C) only reaches the first hop C  →  dropped\nresult:   [PrefixSID(A)] = 16003, out via C, 0 extra labels",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b16-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 523,
   "width": 405,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
